    {
      "type": "content",
      "label": "HOW TO START — STEP 1",
      "title": "HOW TO START — STEP 1",
      "variant": "default",
      "displayNumber": 3,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "How to start?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Download and install the Safe Family application on your phone"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "DOWNLOAD FROM"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Scan the code to add the application"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "content",
      "label": "STEP 2",
      "title": "STEP 2",
      "variant": "default",
      "displayNumber": 4,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Launch the Safe Family application:"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Enter your phone number, to which you will receive an SMS with a login code (and phone number confirmation)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "content",
      "label": "STEP 3",
      "title": "STEP 3",
      "variant": "default",
      "displayNumber": 5,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Add the device to the application:"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Press the \"Select\" button in the \"I want to locate another GPS device\" field."
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Scan the QR code from the box or device"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Follow the further instructions in the application"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "content",
      "label": "STEP 4",
      "title": "STEP 4",
      "variant": "warning",
      "displayNumber": 6,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "If you have a device with a SIM card supplied by Locon, after completing the previous steps your device will be ready to use within a few minutes."
        },
        {
          "kind": "warning",
          "text": "Warning! Your SIM card must not have a PIN code."
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "How to install your own SIM card? You will find the full instructions in the User Manual (QR code on page 2) or by contacting the Locon helpline."
        }
      ]
    },
