    {
      "type": "content",
      "label": "USAGE SAFETY",
      "title": "USAGE SAFETY",
      "variant": "default",
      "displayNumber": 24,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Usage safety guidelines"
        },
        {
          "kind": "list",
          "items": [
            "Do not place unnecessary metal objects near the device, as this may cause problems with its operation.",
            "All safety rules for using electrical devices must be observed, including not inserting metal objects into the device and avoiding any actions that may expose the user to electric shock.",
            "Do not use the device in dusty, humid, contaminated places or in places where a magnetic field is present.",
            "The device should be handled gently, dropping or other physical damage may render it unfit for use.",
            "Do not disassemble the device or any of its parts yourself, and do not make structural changes to the product. Do not modify the device software."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "content",
      "label": "SAR",
      "title": "SAR",
      "variant": "default",
      "displayNumber": 25,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Information on the operation of radio frequency waves and the specific absorption rate (SAR)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "The Locon Watch Slay AI GPS watch has been designed to meet all applicable safety requirements regarding the impact of radio waves on the human body."
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "These requirements result from scientific recommendations, including permissible levels guaranteeing the safety of all persons, regardless of their age and health condition. In recommendations regarding the impact of radio waves, the term \"specific absorption rate\" (SAR) is used. SAR value tests are conducted using standard methods, when the watch transmits at maximum power in all used frequency bands."
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "For this watch model Locon Watch Slay AI the highest SAR value measured by Locon is 0.489 W/kg (head) and 2.894 W/kg (body). The regulatory limits are 2 W/kg (head) and 4 W/kg (body)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "content",
      "label": "WEEE",
      "title": "WEEE",
      "variant": "default",
      "displayNumber": 26,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Proper product disposal"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "The marking placed on the product or in texts relating to it indicates that the product, after the expiry of the use period, should not be disposed of with other household waste."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "content",
      "label": "RECYCLING",
      "title": "RECYCLING",
      "variant": "default",
      "displayNumber": 27,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Proper product recycling"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "A product marked with a crossed-out bin symbol indicates that it must not be disposed of together with ordinary municipal waste. For the protection of the environment and human health, it should be responsibly sorted and recycled."
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "After the end of use, please hand over the device to a selective collection point for electrical and electronic equipment or contact the seller for detailed information on return options and safe disposal of the device in accordance with applicable regulations. Thank you for your responsible attitude towards environmental protection."
        }
      ]
    },
